licted on whether this improves the source code meaningfully. I do find the simpler \"error check and return error\" to be more readable, and Godot itself boasts its source code's readability a bunch. \nThat would be a counterargument for every error macro, though, and this is a pattern that is too hard to ignore, especially in parsers.\n\nPerhaps the `static_assert` and `unlikely` justify it? Makes me wonder how much of a difference `unlikely` makes here. And we can always change our mind later. Have a different name, more `GUARD` macros?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121617#pullrequestreview-4763318792","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121617","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-23T10:48:16Z"},{"id":4763374307,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-tS4w","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"d8d701977c82dd8f8c96a293de1503a4256435c0","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mickeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121617#pullrequestreview-4763374307","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121617","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-23T10:55:10Z"},{"id":4763402773,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-vCFQ","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"d8d701977c82dd8f8c96a293de1503a4256435c0","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","crea